WEBVTT
NOTE OpenIE Planetary 15s v1.0 — game-engines (yo) · elevenlabs:eleven_v4_turbo

1
00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:10.582
<v Narrator>Ni akọkọ, pẹlu fifọ-iwọn-iṣaaju ti o tọ, awọn ere kan ni a ṣe afihan ni ọna kanna lori Windows, macOS, Linux ati awọn ẹrọ nla.

2
00:00:10.662 --> 00:00:18.113
<v Narrator>Ninu awọn ofin ti o wa ni isalẹ, a ṣe akopọ awọn ọna ṣiṣe 32-bit lati ṣe iyatọ laarin wọn.

3
00:00:18.193 --> 00:00:28.990
<v Narrator>Oju-iwe ayelujara ti o ni awọn oju-iwe wẹẹbu, ati pe wọn le ṣe afihan awọn oju-iwe ayelujara ti a fiweranṣẹ si aaye ayelujara kan.
